   "lines": [
    "As usual, May opens",
    "with most gloomy",
    "weather. Was rather",
    "unwell[?] and kept",
    "to the house; yet[?] of",
    "course I have been",
    "thinking a great",
    "deal of Father, but,",
    "I do not know why,",
    "today it has only",
    "given me pleasure",
    "to do so."
   ],
